{"id": "official:sentence:4b10db30-1d66-47ef-a7c2-62480f40bf5a", "text": "他的眼睛是蓝色的。", "shortMeaning": "他眼睛是蓝的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bdad374-24e7-4475-ab52-2f2d685821fc", "text": "他的眼里流出了泪水。", "shortMeaning": "他眼里淌出泪来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:404fdf1b-564f-4140-8e1b-9e2792e9fcbf", "text": "他的眼里涌动着泪花。", "shortMeaning": "他眼眶里直冒泪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4cf9f37-55d3-4987-824d-9b233279bcc5", "text": "他的秘书不承认是她泄露了信息。", "shortMeaning": "他秘书不认是自己走漏了消息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ecd91ae-c961-416d-8c62-824ddc8dd49f", "text": "他的秘书好像了解真相。", "shortMeaning": "他的秘书似乎知道内情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29885d54-64f2-4731-bb2c-22068d68d3f5", "text": "他的笑话把我乐翻了。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的趣话把我逗得不行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1046d739-8a04-48b0-a240-975fe26ed191", "text": "他的第三点说明的是，埃米特试图协调现实与他的理论设计。", "shortMeaning": "第三点讲的是埃米特想把实情和他的理论凑上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a2a31b9-64c7-4f1a-b4b7-126faa17737a", "text": "他的答案要看他的心情而定。", "shortMeaning": "他怎么答，得看他当时心情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3dafe0f-7e1b-4e60-ae5a-d6932d7bbd0e", "text": "他的组织能力很糟。", "shortMeaning": "他不善把事张罗起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d872d502-8cfc-4df7-be62-1bccd97094cf", "text": "他的缺席导致了各种谣言的产生。", "shortMeaning": "他一没露面，闲话就起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07c19096-c1a1-42e2-820e-d2a8ced33437", "text": "他的羽毛球打得真厉害。", "shortMeaning": "他羽毛球打得真凶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4d33aa9-68d6-4fa4-b117-d3de83fc8058", "text": "他的耐心已经到了极限。", "shortMeaning": "他已经忍到头了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:978d6ffc-af8c-4e97-b1cb-7bd03d52850c", "text": "他的肘子把我弄疼了。", "shortMeaning": "他的胳膊肘把我撞疼了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:acb3155f-b4af-4c53-846e-b3748d6d9512", "text": "他的胸中还有足够的斗志。", "shortMeaning": "他心气还没泄。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e5d1b555-cf8e-46ae-864b-fd91e0cc4777", "text": "他的脚步慢下来了。", "shortMeaning": "他脚下慢了下来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e58c839-877a-4c82-8562-7181a9e5b437", "text": "他的脸上呈现了愤怒。", "shortMeaning": "他脸上现出怒色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd2cb3b3-d804-4b8e-b1d4-1df731e4fb6c", "text": "他的脸失去了所有颜色。", "shortMeaning": "他脸白得没了血色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9769fdd-bd8b-4291-a1f5-4ed185724f98", "text": "他的腿部肌肉在他卧床不起的七个月中萎缩了。", "shortMeaning": "躺了七个月，他腿上的肉都缩了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37d9001b-eb49-4df7-b484-03f49f121c01", "text": "他的自行车是蓝色的。", "shortMeaning": "他那辆车是蓝的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b565833-7286-4892-961e-402dcd593cae", "text": "他的英文书不超过五本。", "shortMeaning": "他的英文书不到五本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2157bf8-2ec6-4bcb-ba14-e1f92d01f481", "text": "他的英语多流利啊！", "shortMeaning": "他英语说得真顺！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c0f3966-1ccc-482c-a5e3-4cf7745696a3", "text": "他的英语有了小小的进步。", "shortMeaning": "他英语有了点长进。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4af7f71-fdaf-4204-aad2-20665feb63a1", "text": "他的薪水低，所以买不了房。", "shortMeaning": "他工钱少，买不成房。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1186d17c-7e25-45b4-9283-453a4936bf4a", "text": "他的行为值得尊重。", "shortMeaning": "他这作为值得人敬重。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2f9b20f-f626-441d-9afe-3695b6a2380d", "text": "他的衣服满是补丁。", "shortMeaning": "他衣裳打满了补丁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:734be137-c355-403c-8c4d-1e88592b743a", "text": "他的衬衫被酱汁弄脏了。", "shortMeaning": "他的衬衣让汤汁溅脏了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:752d619f-0cd7-4f90-9281-9cb71c6ed794", "text": "他的袜子是紫色的。", "shortMeaning": "他的袜子是紫的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb8f03af-ae46-416e-b1dc-00bdaab7336f", "text": "他的观点为问题带来了新想法。", "shortMeaning": "他这一说，给这事添了新念头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5db6f2a4-9dde-4e44-a8ba-084036fa9ceb", "text": "他的观点是合理的。", "shortMeaning": "他的看法在理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:99bca40f-83f0-4f79-a030-d5b2d5efc415", "text": "他的观点毫无价值。", "shortMeaning": "他的看法全没价值。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef2f4790-a424-45b6-a592-ddb25a3fceee", "text": "他的计划被驳回了。", "shortMeaning": "他的方案给打回来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6654968-e345-41b1-a5b6-be4dd44c8d2e", "text": "他的记忆力使我惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "他的记性叫我吃惊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76f27afb-d7af-48b2-ba3f-d9c09820e434", "text": "他的评论简洁且击中要害。", "shortMeaning": "他评得简短，却句句戳到点上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4032e54-c509-41b0-ac33-3745145878a1", "text": "他的话暗示着什么？", "shortMeaning": "他这话暗指什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b028b72-c1bc-48fc-83c5-80ab306a4e7c", "text": "他的话深深触动了我们。", "shortMeaning": "他那一番话深深刻在我们心里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff796289-7a9f-4aed-8c2b-68a2d28f6d8d", "text": "他的身材看起来很好。", "shortMeaning": "他身段看着不错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f524f6ec-b9f4-4652-bdb5-b5c925f35c30", "text": "他的车在加油站洗过了。", "shortMeaning": "他的车在油站洗过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7eb8983e-90ca-485c-8494-508c5eead79a", "text": "他的车子光天化日被偷走了。", "shortMeaning": "大白天他的车给人偷了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f104b03-a92d-49bc-b78b-c61e9eb363aa", "text": "他的这本书一点意思也没有。", "shortMeaning": "他这本书毫无趣味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e10bd98-e156-498b-b6af-580cb15067df", "text": "他的选举稳操胜券了。", "shortMeaning": "这场选举他赢定了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76bbfc18-68d0-4d65-825c-7248132acb2f", "text": "他的长相与年龄不符。", "shortMeaning": "他的相貌跟岁数不相称。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:009b1290-324c-4a12-a414-ca3597725bb0", "text": "他的音乐会非常好。", "shortMeaning": "他的音乐会开得很棒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a3f8c6b5-4482-4f6a-9523-8836a061c67f", "text": "他的预言可能会成真。", "shortMeaning": "他说的那话说不定会应验。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9ca0d86-13cd-4abe-bcb8-8625b007ad0a", "text": "他的领导地位坚如磐石。", "shortMeaning": "他领头的位置稳得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e9ac9e6-f1e2-4ba6-919b-ce8e2700eab1", "text": "他的马虎大意导致了这次栽跟头。", "shortMeaning": "这一跤是他马虎惹出来的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17ef6b1d-6f5e-4fd2-9107-e1ae2dd5ffc6", "text": "他的鼻子上长了一个小疙瘩。", "shortMeaning": "他鼻子上起了个小包。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76b4b5d1-662d-48d8-867a-53e3bc4deab6", "text": "他的鼻子看起来像土豆。", "shortMeaning": "他的鼻子看着像土豆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3fc0059c-e146-4664-b442-58e1af40a1ef", "text": "他的鼾声吵得我不能入睡。", "shortMeaning": "他打呼噜吵得我睡不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a51937ed-4231-482e-b093-b66c803da823", "text": "他目不转睛地看着她。", "shortMeaning": "他直勾勾地瞧着她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f85637b9-17d9-473e-830f-f203aeee8f6e", "text": "他相信他能证明它。", "shortMeaning": "他信自己能把它证实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c66a39d0-1c86-4c8c-9305-225aaaa809bc", "text": "他相信我们中间有间谍。", "shortMeaning": "他认定我们里头有内奸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40746315-ef27-44ec-93f1-b59540d18b92", "text": "他看一本推理小说来消遣。", "shortMeaning": "他拿一本推理小说解闷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43e81b58-e167-401f-9dc3-365bea2cd6c4", "text": "他看上去像个不男不女的人。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧着不像男也不像女。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98f1a60c-d565-4df0-8d35-9ddfe48e0eda", "text": "他看上去已经睡着了。", "shortMeaning": "看着他已经睡熟了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6656745-2101-42d9-aa08-069b298f488c", "text": "他看上去是一个十足的绅士。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧着是个十足的君子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c3fd488-6ab5-43f8-bb91-9db426b9190b", "text": "他看上去沾沾自喜。", "shortMeaning": "他一脸自得的样子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca64c717-0794-4fc2-935a-3e27b9afcbd2", "text": "他看上去老，但他还不到30岁。", "shortMeaning": "他看着老，其实不到三十。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1c1c705-aef9-4378-834a-f1ba06485f39", "text": "他看上去脸色铁青。", "shortMeaning": "他脸色发青。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fcdee379-dd11-42db-b312-1fe112c785b7", "text": "他看不见那只鸟了。", "shortMeaning": "那只鸟他瞧不见了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd26eb2b-07d9-423a-bf81-0b116738418f", "text": "他看不起她的成功。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧不上她这份成就。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c20d58b5-35c6-47c6-96bc-c93fe79ef191", "text": "他看了一眼他的表。", "shortMeaning": "他瞅了一眼手表。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66480fc7-33f7-490b-ab7d-b308e0ee89c5", "text": "他看了她一眼就马上离开了。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧她一眼就走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ac970e7-2b51-464b-997a-a80111410fea", "text": "他看什么事都往钱方面去想。", "shortMeaning": "他看什么都先想到钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93e7c078-f9e2-4e60-a84d-e46eeaf2d862", "text": "他看到一位漂亮小姐。", "shortMeaning": "他见到一位好看的姑娘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2b39792-1791-4650-8e49-3103772ef062", "text": "他看到了警察，就逃之夭夭了。", "shortMeaning": "一见警察，他就溜了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:80f7aabc-b12a-45af-a9ba-561232dc7d7f", "text": "他看到我的时候和我说话。", "shortMeaning": "他见着我就跟我搭话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d51ce8c9-f67b-4ced-9007-cce9a409d66f", "text": "他看到我脸色变了。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧见我脸色变了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c10f098d-f9f8-4650-9eff-d64ace0593cf", "text": "他看完了一本汉语语法书，从而对中文的用法有了更深的了解。", "shortMeaning": "他读完一本汉语语法，对中文用法懂得更深。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d515b5b-38f5-4ae5-9291-a8fe793ceeb2", "text": "他看完了二十四史。", "shortMeaning": "他把二十四史读完了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6beb47d9-fbcb-40c8-90d6-13c283cdc9a7", "text": "他看着我什么都不说。", "shortMeaning": "他望着我，一语不发。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8236c19-2cd6-4453-8c1f-893b4be08c08", "text": "他看着那幅画出神。", "shortMeaning": "他望着那幅画，出了神。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ef3b6cd-e2cb-4fdb-ae73-90335abb6a68", "text": "他看见色彩鲜艳的鸟、花朵和树叶。", "shortMeaning": "他看见颜色鲜亮的鸟、花和叶子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75a380b2-40c9-4136-b9f9-9babc9e7a85b", "text": "他看起来像个运动员，但是其实是个作家。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧着像运动员，其实写文章的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62d00a3b-2ab0-45c2-8ff3-c0d66c74f7d8", "text": "他看起来好像很幸福。", "shortMeaning": "他看着像过得很好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1bc41f41-b8e3-4d83-bca5-a53e2cc7896f", "text": "他看起来年轻，但实际上他是四十多岁的人了。", "shortMeaning": "他看着年轻，其实已四十好几。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:047b05d7-65c7-42a2-8c7e-d3ca22c04957", "text": "他看起来很担心自己的健康。", "shortMeaning": "他像是很担心身子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:151fcad9-742c-4efe-a477-cdb0867e50f8", "text": "他看起来忠厚老实。", "shortMeaning": "他瞧着厚道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f34f66a7-a62f-41b2-b017-3ea539e0b70a", "text": "他真地把事搞复杂了。", "shortMeaning": "他真把事情弄乱了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51aeaa68-a116-466f-9354-ce83a6aa868b", "text": "他真的很想做穆斯林。", "shortMeaning": "他是真心要信伊斯兰教。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e6205b1-d23b-479a-965c-3190877c280f", "text": "他真的很热爱音乐。", "shortMeaning": "他是真爱音乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03a56511-9ef3-4a7e-9501-39ac5a9c1855", "text": "他真的很爱好语言。", "shortMeaning": "他真心喜欢语言。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac1dbcc8-1082-4962-8753-4e962138a65e", "text": "他睡得像个宝贝似的。", "shortMeaning": "他睡着，像个宝贝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7680edb1-e10d-45b0-9bd7-30b95cc409cc", "text": "他睡得像朵玫瑰花。", "shortMeaning": "他睡着，像朵玫瑰花。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3335c4dd-b71d-44a4-a3fb-f2019cc10700", "text": "他睡着的时候，一个高个子的男人钻空子偷走了他的手机。", "shortMeaning": "他睡着时，一个高个男人趁机摸走了手机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1f916e4-bd70-45c8-b7f1-1a751c132b9d", "text": "他睡着的时候，打呼声很响。", "shortMeaning": "他睡时鼾声很响。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e00c9b75-2dd0-4d41-b174-aacbe5c501ea", "text": "他瞄准了，却没命中。", "shortMeaning": "他瞄得准，却没打中。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:593d8907-484b-4bd6-997e-8097157a8b21", "text": "他瞥了那个女孩一眼。", "shortMeaning": "他朝那女孩瞟了一眼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d23535d2-571c-437c-97b4-053d1d04e073", "text": "他知道他在讲什么。", "shortMeaning": "他清楚自己在说什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:776cc840-0014-444e-beee-248299a72f52", "text": "他知道她有点不对劲。", "shortMeaning": "他知道她有些不对头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51b8fc1d-cb4b-4df1-b54f-815ca942ec07", "text": "他知道如何做收音机。", "shortMeaning": "他懂得怎么做收音机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fb78d09-96cc-4b6c-a6cb-2e4514b15291", "text": "他知道怎么关掉引擎。", "shortMeaning": "他会关发动机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0748928c-b0ca-4999-98ef-4a32090e8c0c", "text": "他知道怎么玩扑克。", "shortMeaning": "他会打扑克。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8a13694-4ee8-4db7-8a9b-ddbb8ce6ad44", "text": "他知道怎么玩棒球。", "shortMeaning": "他懂棒球怎么打。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9eae5417-412f-42f4-991c-1b811aec56a5", "text": "他砍了花园里的一棵树。", "shortMeaning": "园子里的一棵树给他砍倒了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:be96cf46-c2a9-411a-b9e9-31d0479a6f77", "text": "他砸坏的是这扇窗。", "shortMeaning": "被他砸坏的就是这扇窗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aeede5f9-2eee-4d2f-b1fe-0e7793f674d7", "text": "他确实很穷，但是他很幸福。", "shortMeaning": "他穷是穷，日子却美满。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d954043-79d4-4b40-80f6-55a013006600", "text": "他确实是个聪明的小孩。", "shortMeaning": "他真是个伶俐的孩子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9652e6b5-e3a4-40c8-832f-1220d13cf33c", "text": "他磕碎了下巴，掉了几颗牙。", "shortMeaning": "他磕破下巴，掉了好几颗牙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94bad794-3743-4362-9d78-e49aae0c1314", "text": "他祈求上天帮助那位小女孩。", "shortMeaning": "他求老天帮那小姑娘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a8f53e3-f793-4242-8452-702c031e84b0", "text": "他禁止斯库拉再与易迪尔见面。", "shortMeaning": "他不许斯库拉再跟易迪尔见面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ea3c839-c2d2-4d05-8e7f-145355807650", "text": "他离开东京，去了大阪。", "shortMeaning": "他从东京走了，去了大阪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62245061-4334-4371-9c2f-b6f0f5fc694d", "text": "他离开房间的时候，向我鞠了躬。", "shortMeaning": "他出屋时朝我鞠了一躬。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02bce6dc-4d2f-41ec-88f4-eacd2ef77c66", "text": "他离网球高手还差得远呢。", "shortMeaning": "他还算不上网球好手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8dc3c8b4-b087-4b98-b962-08588fe07b66", "text": "他离诚实差得远呢。", "shortMeaning": "他跟实诚差得远。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23a2a80d-97ff-4d24-baa9-71a8ac9a60eb", "text": "他私下给我看了她的照片。", "shortMeaning": "他私下把她的相片给我看了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:613d4c37-cce0-4ab0-9e70-dcf1ee2088d5", "text": "他移开，让卡车通过。", "shortMeaning": "他闪到一边，让卡车过去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d05e3f51-eadf-4f64-97ba-2a5c5694234c", "text": "他穿上了黑色的外套。", "shortMeaning": "他套上了黑外衣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52c57a54-93ef-48e1-a1d1-9654c0bd20d6", "text": "他穿了一件深色毛衣。", "shortMeaning": "他身上是件深色毛衣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b2a2fc5-8fe7-4b8e-b441-3385b05d3b1e", "text": "他穿了一条牛仔裤。", "shortMeaning": "他下身是条牛仔裤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c43c632-207b-4614-b690-664cf7a46a6f", "text": "他穿着一件磨得破破烂烂的西装。", "shortMeaning": "他穿着件磨烂了的西装。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00f99c3e-fa8b-4c45-b6bd-2d0513cfd7af", "text": "他穿着一件蓝色上衣。", "shortMeaning": "他身上是件蓝上衣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d4f8ae9-0cb4-4714-8cba-10e326bc7973", "text": "他穿着上很不讲究。", "shortMeaning": "他穿戴从不讲究。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:691c955e-a426-407c-8202-310f2619c63e", "text": "他穿着衣服冲进房间。", "shortMeaning": "他衣裳未换就冲进屋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca3cab46-3d5a-44e1-8974-e73c42575bd7", "text": "他穿衣服一向很随便，颜色、样式都无所谓。", "shortMeaning": "他穿衣随意，颜色样式都不挑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aeb50f70-7099-4f01-ac2c-b78a03a898b8", "text": "他站在他母亲的后面。", "shortMeaning": "他立在他母亲身后。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59327bba-1d91-4091-8e1b-ce24bcc81ec7", "text": "他站在入口的边上。", "shortMeaning": "他站在入口一侧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b1457a5-efe7-4768-839a-db817f56ad02", "text": "他站在窗外凝望着我。", "shortMeaning": "他立在窗外定定望着我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6127b532-7100-483f-b4c4-969c8e411d85", "text": "他站在那里,一脸茫然。", "shortMeaning": "他站在那儿，满脸茫然。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cb61cfd-8ccd-4192-b963-6374c501576c", "text": "他竞然不是完人而已经成了伟人。", "shortMeaning": "他并非完人，倒成了伟人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b141ee0d-cb67-4fa9-a8b9-4a02a7d72d82", "text": "他竟然从来都没有放过风筝。", "shortMeaning": "他竟从没放过风筝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e92c02f3-182c-4456-a8bb-ac61963fc211", "text": "他竟然厚着脸皮穿过我们的花园。", "shortMeaning": "他竟拉下脸从我们园子里穿过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cd6b1e8-d651-4f5e-b830-c4e8b40bc5a5", "text": "他竟然还给我装傻。", "shortMeaning": "他居然还跟我装糊涂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7705949a-6776-415e-b1d6-8a01466c4f1a", "text": "他竭尽全力地讨好他老婆。", "shortMeaning": "他把浑身解数都使出来讨老婆欢心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a9bea1e-654f-49e7-8f9e-1968af6ff098", "text": "他等了几秒，然后打开了门。", "shortMeaning": "他等了几秒，才把门推开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a04005d4-d4eb-4ec8-8ebc-323bdc8f713b", "text": "他简单地阐述了他的理由。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己的道理约略说了说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9860cbd4-6c0f-4ad6-93c9-107f0af25f5c", "text": "他累得再也走不动了。", "shortMeaning": "他乏得再也迈不开步。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40584aa3-eec5-4226-9c93-2cd016115363", "text": "他终于到了绝望之井。", "shortMeaning": "他终于走到了那口绝望井边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd6873a0-c6c2-4dc4-8b1a-c7a9991d1df8", "text": "他终于完成了他的目标。", "shortMeaning": "他到底把目标达成了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c15897a7-e1de-4ae6-88a5-944ca24db961", "text": "他终于弄清楚怎么搞定这事了。", "shortMeaning": "他总算摸清这事的门道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:987d2bd1-3fb9-4c39-888b-34a5956fe242", "text": "他终于恢复了理智。", "shortMeaning": "他总算清醒过来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6aff632a-36c3-4379-aa73-21609d627680", "text": "他终于达到了自己的目标。", "shortMeaning": "他最终圆了自己的愿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5bda03ca-6151-41ad-89ed-dc9bb71406b6", "text": "他终于达到目标了。", "shortMeaning": "他这下子把目标办到了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28c3d2a4-6f13-47eb-bba8-8aa08ac76356", "text": "他经常在我们的谈话中打岔。", "shortMeaning": "他常在我们说话时插嘴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b30082b0-379f-4a4f-8b40-c27ebd08d0ea", "text": "他经常坐在我旁边听音乐。", "shortMeaning": "他常坐我旁边听曲子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aad907ca-6bca-4b2d-af9a-64a715f03a76", "text": "他经常忘记信守承诺。", "shortMeaning": "他常把答应了的事忘掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66b3bdb6-7cd3-4913-8a13-745707d21422", "text": "他经常插到我们的谈话中来。", "shortMeaning": "他动不动就插进我们的话里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10fa56ae-e17e-446c-a860-143e11ea4146", "text": "他经济上依靠他的太太。", "shortMeaning": "他钱上靠太太。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30cc1c58-d9e5-4c01-8ed7-0c7ee7b2f754", "text": "他经由巴黎去了伦敦。", "shortMeaning": "他经巴黎到伦敦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83c9bc57-8771-4554-afdc-b6e4a612877c", "text": "他经营着一家鞋店。", "shortMeaning": "他开着一家鞋铺。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6fc176c-564c-41d5-9360-fd7f5aa2a67d", "text": "他给了他一个新名字。", "shortMeaning": "他给他起了个新名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f3fdffb-a4c4-4881-acfb-fa07e926d977", "text": "他给了以下的答复。", "shortMeaning": "他回话如下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbad504d-4433-49a3-b55b-b771aa60f6ea", "text": "他给了它一个新名字。", "shortMeaning": "他给它另起了名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcc70a6b-aceb-4022-8897-010c66b0e1fc", "text": "他给了我食物和钱。", "shortMeaning": "他给了我吃的和钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29677de7-cfc8-4b02-bf7f-365b69aa33b3", "text": "他给他的母亲写信。", "shortMeaning": "他给他母亲去信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e019e4f1-7cc5-4626-a667-07828d6f2ba5", "text": "他给出了三个错误答案。", "shortMeaning": "他答错了三处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9c41cc3-9bf0-4d47-aabc-e06b3ee601f4", "text": "他给她买了些巧克力。", "shortMeaning": "他买了几块巧克力给她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26f77dad-a36f-4894-a777-6b0290b9a795", "text": "他给我们看他母亲的照片。", "shortMeaning": "他把母亲的相片拿给我们看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ee52826-9fca-49ad-8914-ceb17c90dc98", "text": "他给我们讲了一个有趣的故事。", "shortMeaning": "他讲了个有趣的故事给我们听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f59c540-1b40-4cb7-be34-4984e3bf9721", "text": "他给我们讲了一个有趣的故事，我们都笑了起来。", "shortMeaning": "他讲的趣事把我们全逗笑了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3dadab8-d14f-4aba-9f82-243a737afd79", "text": "他给我做了套衣服。", "shortMeaning": "他给我做了一身衣裳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bad58562-68eb-41f6-8780-2a1a7047078e", "text": "他给我偷偷地展示了她的照片。", "shortMeaning": "他背着人把她的相片亮给我看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d81ce0d5-b7eb-4fd7-b8ed-52216357f4ba", "text": "他给我写了一封很长的信。", "shortMeaning": "他给我来了一封长信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d793a3a5-a773-4643-84f9-818f998d3909", "text": "他给我看了他最新剧的底稿。", "shortMeaning": "他给我看了他新戏的稿子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7a10019-2b1b-48f0-a5d6-c5beb64e8598", "text": "他给我看了他的影集。", "shortMeaning": "他让我翻了他的相册。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1a874b1-1205-4938-b16c-294451876b76", "text": "他给我讲述了他的一生。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己一辈子的事讲给我听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ea3e5e7-e57f-4d17-afa5-bf07a6be626b", "text": "他给我雕了一个木娃娃。", "shortMeaning": "他给我雕了个木头娃娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:090c0918-b450-4d5a-8b2c-e0eb75ce7cde", "text": "他给车罩上一层车罩。", "shortMeaning": "他给车套上了车衣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43f370d0-f86a-4f06-a0b9-ac2ce2880292", "text": "他绝不是说人坏话的人。", "shortMeaning": "他绝不是背后说人的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cb95bed-4deb-4934-a593-1144701c5721", "text": "他绝对不是会去做那种事的人。", "shortMeaning": "那种事他绝不会去干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19aa4ff1-e36e-4347-848f-b1b8b6bcbca8", "text": "他绞尽脑汁想办法搞定这件事。", "shortMeaning": "他费尽心思琢磨怎么办成这事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5eb45c33-ef40-44d5-8b44-71d79f898b38", "text": "他继承了他父亲的事业。", "shortMeaning": "他接了他父亲的营生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab778d6b-6c51-4b12-97bf-1c48cb73074a", "text": "他继承了他父亲的财产。", "shortMeaning": "他得了父亲的产业。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0e0b849-4eb0-4d26-8a7b-24cffea229d4", "text": "他继续读他的书，就好像什么都没发生过一样。", "shortMeaning": "他照旧读他的书，像什么事都没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30afa8ce-e4c0-4202-b0d4-eec1f7da0ef8", "text": "他编造了一个借口。", "shortMeaning": "他编了个由头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5b9b18a-d455-4d3b-8cd9-e7bc79afd1b2", "text": "他老了，所以这任务对他来说一定很难。", "shortMeaning": "他上了年纪，这差事对他也难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5da9ff5c-edfc-4de8-a91b-f01e41c1101b", "text": "他老是给别人扣帽子。", "shortMeaning": "他动不动就给人安罪名。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f16890e6-91c2-41cb-b078-8a2dd9626614", "text": "他肯定六十多岁了。", "shortMeaning": "他准有六十多了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:464a52ad-16fe-4e23-b15e-2dfbf363704f", "text": "他肯定是吃了兴奋剂才会跑得那么快。", "shortMeaning": "他跑那么快，准是吃了药。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ea48f7a-a88f-4ae5-9c30-83354e1d1610", "text": "他能为你暗箱操作。", "shortMeaning": "他能替你私下里打点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a29b62e-45ad-4d34-b852-489d0344292e", "text": "他能将中文运用自如。", "shortMeaning": "他中文用得随心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aceac808-18e1-42b1-9ccf-a0b0e48bf635", "text": "他能将英语运用自如。", "shortMeaning": "他英语使得顺手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d18e2e24-4ff7-4aee-816e-4116c84cee57", "text": "他能很好地读懂法语。", "shortMeaning": "他读法文读得很通。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01a2d42e-26f9-4074-b674-b4503d1ca3cf", "text": "他能教授英语和法语。", "shortMeaning": "英语法语他都能教。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c4e5b6b8-5f97-43ec-8a72-b6ad40073329", "text": "他能讲流利的日语。", "shortMeaning": "他日语讲得流利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:503e5af7-edfd-45bb-b014-6cb54b656321", "text": "他能赚多少就赚多少。", "shortMeaning": "能挣多少他就挣多少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76b85235-89ce-420f-bf59-ab84d3e9a2d1", "text": "他能跑得和我一样快。", "shortMeaning": "他跑起来跟我一样快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56aa57d4-377f-4234-9c51-e438a44d879c", "text": "他能轻松地读英语。", "shortMeaning": "他看英文不费劲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:462f401e-77e9-4139-96bf-3233be8c45cc", "text": "他脚受伤了，不能再继续踢足球。", "shortMeaning": "他脚伤了，不能再踢球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c7193b6-db68-4714-bf0e-e247b9f28606", "text": "他脸红了，不知该怎么接近她。", "shortMeaning": "他红了脸，不知怎样去跟她接近。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:060607a1-e8b5-4666-8f2d-adea61d20fad", "text": "他自发地提出了他的帮助。", "shortMeaning": "他主动提出要帮忙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cc7f0aa-6a8e-4805-90ea-1e07bfd1fa74", "text": "他自己准备了晚餐。", "shortMeaning": "他自己做了晚饭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e31a53b0-c3ce-457d-b207-da95f7fa5a63", "text": "他自己撞坏了左臂。", "shortMeaning": "他把自己的左臂撞伤了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0fe0d12b-e508-4f80-8ba1-a691dccee6bf", "text": "他自己的生存现在更重要了。", "shortMeaning": "眼下他顾命最要紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aeafde82-df29-4eea-90f5-eaf5d15a4743", "text": "他自认为他自己是个伟大的诗人。", "shortMeaning": "他自以为是了不起的诗人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5e864e9-a220-4513-8cf9-8497f16c9da0", "text": "他至今为止非常幸福。", "shortMeaning": "他到今天过得很美满。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bb96a7f0-bace-4245-95da-bfb2f2f9b8c1", "text": "他花了50美元在夏威夷租了一辆汽车。", "shortMeaning": "他在夏威夷花五十美元租了辆车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3ace53b-5701-4f42-b44c-65defbba5d19", "text": "他花了一大笔钱来帮助穷人。", "shortMeaning": "他拿出大笔钱帮穷人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb18fcaf-175a-48ca-b065-385d376251ab", "text": "他花很多钱买了辆新车。", "shortMeaning": "他花了不少钱买了辆新车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53946ba8-9ff4-4046-961a-80b2e13fe942", "text": "他英勇地孤军奋战，但面对如此强弱悬殊的局面，他的商业计划无法得到接受。", "shortMeaning": "他一个人硬撑，可众寡太悬殊，他的生意打算没人肯接。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab7a19c0-579d-4ee6-85ad-19f56fc4c34c", "text": "他英勇的行为带给了他光荣。", "shortMeaning": "他这份勇气给他带来光彩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d4bc0e5-abef-449f-a1e5-7e901f7aec1f", "text": "他英文得到了九十分。", "shortMeaning": "他英文考了九十分。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:434b2580-cdc8-4ebb-a762-33f463b648e8", "text": "他英语说得很流利。", "shortMeaning": "他英语讲得溜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3486345f-6573-4ae7-8853-82376bc38055", "text": "他获得了诺贝尔文学奖。", "shortMeaning": "他得了诺贝尔文学奖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c236a4d5-4f09-41ac-ae22-a1318adfcf74", "text": "他葫芦里不知卖的是什么药？", "shortMeaning": "不知道他心里打的什么主意？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e6e4385-b1d5-4330-a69d-3dab8c1e142e", "text": "他藏到一个大石头后面了。", "shortMeaning": "他躲到一块大石头后头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:316119ee-7f78-4095-ae52-000a6b6c8cce", "text": "他虽年轻，但十分英明。", "shortMeaning": "他年纪轻，却很有见识。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbe9f625-2cb9-44ea-8198-b9ecdaa52811", "text": "他虽然不是歌手，但他唱的非常优美。", "shortMeaning": "他不是歌手，唱得却很好听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b280d0b1-4d71-4e74-b80a-1fb27d25cb75", "text": "他虽然穷，却很幸福。", "shortMeaning": "他虽穷，日子却过得乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52627038-3b74-4fc5-a906-999cb3c8d616", "text": "他衣着像个绅士，言行举止却像个小丑。", "shortMeaning": "他穿得像君子，做派像小丑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55c7a162-9d70-47a8-a6cc-7df4d831c77e", "text": "他表现得像疯了一样。", "shortMeaning": "他闹得跟疯了似的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
